    "scenesThatPass": [
      "ROSIE: The signs say \"Don’t Mess With Texas\".\nAURORA: Texas certainly has messed with me.",
      "AURORA: Why? Because I care what happens to you?\nMELANIE: You're ruining my life!",
      "ROSIE: I’m worried about her, Patsy. She went to bed yesterday at three- thirty and hasn't gotten up yet.\nPATSY: She's probably headed for the big snap. Long overdue. {a distinctive jacket) Would you take this to Melly?\nROSIE: She’s been crying. Alot.\nPATSY: It’s her guilt finally manifesting itself. You know she has to be feeling responsibility for all the problems the kids are having. Problems …",
      "PATSY: I get the credit card bills. I can track ‘em down if I have to.\nROSIE: I just wanna do something about Aurora's mood. When she’s pissed off, everybody drowns.\nPATSY: She needs professional help... always has.\nROSIE: Therapy?",
      "ROSIE: You're right. I know I'm surrounded by people who love me. I just can’t seem to snap out of this.\nAURORA: Even here? You love the beach.\nROSIE: I know. I know. I'm still so depressed.\nAURORA: What can I do to help?"
    ]
  },
